  "id": "enchiladas-verdes",
  "name": "Enchiladas Verdes",
  "subtitle": "Chicken enchiladas with tomatillo-serrano sauce",
  "description": "Tender chicken and corn tortillas are layered with a bright green tomatillo sauce, queso fresco, onion, and cilantro.",
